<Layout title="Join the conversation — Tributary" description="Help shape the Tributary whitepaper proposal as a creator or builder. Send your interest and perspective to the Tributary team."><section class="join-page"><div class="join-story"><FlowBands id="signup-flow" tone="green"/><div class="join-story-copy"><span class="eyebrow">HELP SHAPE WHAT’S NEXT</span><h1>Your work.<br />A fair share.<br />A better future.</h1><p>Publish code others build on? Help define royalties that could support your project. Builders are welcome to challenge the model too.</p><a class="text-link" href="/license">Read the proposal <Icon/></a><span class="join-story-note">CREATORS FIRST. COMMUNITY SHAPED.</span></div></div><div class="join-form-panel"><span class="eyebrow">JOIN THE CONVERSATION</span><h2>Let’s make it work.</h2><p>The proposed terms are still open. Start with your perspective.</p><JoinForm/></div></section></Layout>
